Subject: Resolve SOP Subject Attention Procedure

& [ProcedureIdentity] is effectless
  + [procedure_id] is attention.resolve_sop_subject
  + [version] is 0.1.1
  + [purpose] is retrieve a proof-carrying Cantor definition before provider articulation
  + [authority] is experimental_fixture_only

& [ActivationPattern] is contextual
  + activate when the stimulus asks what Cantor means, is, represents, or governs
  + extract only the named subject; bind purpose to the preserved caller stimulus in the host
  + leave unrelated stimuli uncalled

& [Transform] is bounded
  * require subject cantor in profile 0.1
  * invoke the pinned read-only Cantor query fixture
  * preserve verified quotes, proof, faults, omissions, and result digest
  * project the verified result as an AttentionFrame to llama.cpp
  - never: perform an external semantic effect
  - never: promote fixture authority to production authority
